                        "form": "светодио́дах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "df231721-0607-3042-9474-ecbfec2f617a",
                        "entry_id": "495158a5-5be3-3aa8-9659-bdcae3f3c8a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "техн. полупроводниковый прибор, излучающий свет при пропускании через него электрического тока"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6abc80e-0295-4ab9-9064-914a5d61109c",
                                "sense_id": "df231721-0607-3042-9474-ecbfec2f617a",
                                "text": "Свет здесь исходит от мерцающих на потолке светодиодов."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "64e42c5e-9bd0-4678-9fb4-7e019d3b32aa",
                                "sense_id": "df231721-0607-3042-9474-ecbfec2f617a",
                                "text": "Подбирая материал для светодиодов, можно получать свечение разного цвета, что позволяет в принципе создавать экраны цветного телевидения."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6b66d36a-14c9-4824-a86a-333753bf5845",
                        "source_entry_id": "495158a5-5be3-3aa8-9659-bdcae3f3c8a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "df231721-0607-3042-9474-ecbfec2f617a",
                        "target_lang_word": "light-emitting diode",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "light-emitting diode",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f76148d4-0976-39c2-8c72-bbe7185f9f12",
                                        "entry_id": "39fcfc73-bc79-3126-a65a-0e56f14b3788",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A rectifying semiconductor device which converts electrical energy into electromagnetic radiation of a wavelength in or near the visible spectrum of light."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a78a8f85-0535-446c-8256-a9aef4b73b32",
                        "source_entry_id": "495158a5-5be3-3aa8-9659-bdcae3f3c8a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "df231721-0607-3042-9474-ecbfec2f617a",
                        "target_lang_word": "LED",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "LED",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3b8f47c-abf4-3c4c-88a5-432f75ff045f",
                                        "entry_id": "5ecebd0f-e97a-3ac2-8a9a-a8212920cb87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of light-emitting diode."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "initialism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a55e5b5-e092-4d13-a582-9d8360c87f87",
                                                "sense_id": "d3b8f47c-abf4-3c4c-88a5-432f75ff045f",
                                                "text": "The area already has plenty of loud billboards and klieg lights that have drawn complaints from some neighborhood groups, so the city is concerned about anything billboardesque. Mr. Astani’s application to build the LED panels is undergoing an environmental review by city planning officials."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc894e3d-5c21-439a-bfaa-c4ee5f2b5f4b",
                                                "sense_id": "d3b8f47c-abf4-3c4c-88a5-432f75ff045f",
                                                "text": "The light-emitting capacity of an LED is measured in megacandela [recte millicandelas] or mcd. Small commercial LEDs range from 10 to about 5000 mcd."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73a18c6b-73da-4dda-a573-fa643e3654cb",
                                                "sense_id": "d3b8f47c-abf4-3c4c-88a5-432f75ff045f",
                                                "text": "In some projects, the fiber optic cable will be mounted on the LEDs (D1, D6, D8, and on U22) or the phototransistor (Q4). […] Light is transmitted from the color LED, through the fiber optic cable, to control the NPN transistor (Q2) and red LED (D1)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "47cbed3e-fb2e-45f0-94e9-06d0ae4adf35",
                        "source_entry_id": "495158a5-5be3-3aa8-9659-bdcae3f3c8a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "df231721-0607-3042-9474-ecbfec2f617a",
                        "target_lang_word": "Leuchtdiode",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Leuchtdiode",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e20c4862-c0ec-33fb-8235-1761b1344183",
                                        "entry_id": "9cd4ecf0-245e-3db2-8e0b-04f0dea90495",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "leuchtendes, elektronisches Bauteil"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0396aeb9-515a-42f5-850e-9d112aae7397",
                                                "sense_id": "e20c4862-c0ec-33fb-8235-1761b1344183",
                                                "text": "Nachdem er sich im Laden 5 Leuchtdioden gekauft hatte, konnte er an seinem Gerät weiter bauen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a6f41dd-14a1-4f81-80e8-4dbd8342b30d",
                                                "sense_id": "e20c4862-c0ec-33fb-8235-1761b1344183",
                                                "text": "„Über einen Knopf aus zwei Halbkreisen und einer Anzeige aus fünf blauen Leuchtdioden an jedem Fenstersitz können sie selbst eine stufenlose, elektro-chromatische Verdunkelung der Scheiben vornehmen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfbeaa88-b28b-4d0d-ab1e-6a195a3aa4fd",
                                                "sense_id": "e20c4862-c0ec-33fb-8235-1761b1344183",
                                                "text": "„24 Millionen Leuchtdioden versammelt der Bildschirm-Gigant auf einer Fläche von über 50 Quadratmetern, fugenlos zusammengesetzt aus 96 rund 14 Kilogramm schweren Panels, die einzeln ausgetauscht werden können.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "922b2191-2e07-4cfa-87c6-3c0500168cea",
                        "source_entry_id": "495158a5-5be3-3aa8-9659-bdcae3f3c8a3",
